# Nothing here is needed to run the tool: it is standard library only.
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build/preview artefacts
docs/_solution.html
*.tmp.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIDENTIALITY
#
# The brief is explicit: "The input pack is Kuku's own content, shared just
# for this assignment. You're welcome to use it with AI tools for your work,
# but please don't publish or share it." This repository is public, so:
#
#   - the screenplays themselves never leave this machine.
#   - all-candidates.json is every one of the 156 windows with all their
#     beats, which is 38% of the pack reproduced verbatim. It is a debug
#     artefact, not one of the required deliverables, so it stays local.
#
# What does go up is out/promos.json and the files beside it: the twenty
# exported promos. The brief requires "a folder of unedited outputs from
# running your solution", and those outputs quote 4.5% of the pack - the
# least that can be published and still hand over a working deliverable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/scripts/*.txt
out/all-candidates.json
